SUMMARY:✨☀️ The Golden Light of Abundance Sound Bath✨☀️
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**✨☀️ The Golden 
 Light of Abundance ☀️✨**\n\nAs summer reaches its golden peak\, natu
 re reminds us of the beauty of abundance. Gardens are flourishing\, flower
 s are blooming\, and the warmth of the sun invites us to slow down\, breat
 he deeply\, and simply receive.\n\nJoin me for a deeply relaxing Sound Bat
 h as we immerse ourselves in healing vibrations and the radiant energy of 
 golden light. As crystal singing bowls\, Himalayan bowls\, and chimes surr
 ound you\, you'll be invited to release stress\, restore balance\, and awa
 ken the abundance already present within your heart.\n\n"Like the golden s
 un of late summer\, may your inner light shine with peace\, gratitude\, an
 d abundant joy." ✨\n\n🌞 Sunday\, August 2nd\n⏰ 1:00 PM (Please arri
 ve by 12:45 PM to settle in and choose your space. First come\, first serv
 ed.)\n📍 Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n2 Science of Mind Way\, 
 Asheville\, NC\nHeld in the Sanctuary\n\n💛 Sliding Scale: $10–$20\n\n
 **🧘 What to Bring:**\n• Yoga mat or something comfortable to lie on\n
 • Blanket & pillow for extra coziness\n• Eye pillow/mask (optional)\n\
 nAllow yourself this time to pause\, replenish\, and bask in the golden li
 ght of late summer. Leave feeling lighter\, calmer\, and deeply renewed.\n
 I look forward to sharing this peaceful afternoon with you. 🌻\n\n#Sound
 Bath #SoundHealing #Asheville #CenterForSpiritualLiving #CrystalSingingBow
 ls #HealingVibrations #Meditation #Relaxation #MindBodySpirit #SummerWelln
 ess #GoldenLight #Abundance #InnerPeace #AshevilleEvents
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/center-for-spiritual-living-asheville
 /events/315876272/
