SUMMARY:🤖✨ Wed Nite Special: Does AI Have a Prayer?
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**🤖✨ Wed Nite Spec
 ial: Does AI Have a Prayer?**\nwith Bob Michel\, RScP\n\n📅 Wednesday\, 
 Aug 5th *(Date Changed from July 29th)*\n🕡 6:30 PM\n💝 Love Offering\
 n\nArtificial intelligence is transforming the way we live\, work\, create
 \, and communicate—but what does it mean for our spiritual lives?\nJoin 
 us for an engaging and thought-provoking evening as Bob Michel\, RScP\, le
 ads a fascinating exploration into the intersection of AI\, consciousness\
 , prayer\, and spirituality.\n\nRather than focusing on fear or hype\, we'
 ll consider how artificial intelligence can serve as a valuable tool while
  remembering that our deepest human gifts—love\, compassion\, wisdom\, c
 reativity\, intuition\, and spiritual connection—cannot be replaced by t
 echnology.\n\nWhether you're excited about AI\, skeptical of it\, or simpl
 y curious\, this conversation offers a welcoming space to explore meaningf
 ul questions together.\n\n**🌟 We'll explore topics such as:**\n🤖 Wha
 t role can AI play in our spiritual lives?\n💭 Can technology support pr
 ayer\, meditation\, and personal growth?\n❤️ What makes human consciou
 sness unique?\n🌎 How do we use AI wisely\, ethically\, and compassionat
 ely?\n✨ How can we remain grounded in Spirit while embracing innovation?
 \n\n📺 **Can't join us in person?** We're excited to **live stream this 
 event on our public [YouTube channel](https://www.youtube.com/@cslashevill
 e)**[\,](https://www.youtube.com/@cslasheville) making it easy for everyon
 e to participate from wherever they are. Join the conversation online and 
 be part of this timely exploration into AI and spirituality.\n\nBring your
  questions\, your curiosity\, and an open mind as we reflect together on t
 he opportunities and challenges of living thoughtfully—and spiritually
 —in the age of artificial intelligence.\n\nEveryone is welcome. No prior
  knowledge of AI or spirituality is required—just a willingness to explo
 re.\n\n*We look forward to sharing this timely and inspiring conversation 
 with you!*\n\n#AIandSpirituality #ArtificialIntelligence #ConsciousLiving 
 #SpiritualGrowth #CenterForSpiritualLivingAsheville #CommunityCommonsAshev
 ille #CSLAsheville #InspiredLiving #ScienceOfMind #MindfulTechnology #Cons
 ciousCommunity
